        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository cb88ff0e-247b-48de-86ab-6cab6f21c9c8).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have new intel on our case. After we taught a certain Italian singer her lesson, our client found out that drug lord Rico Delgado is a certified hater of the Japanese singer Ado, and has prepared four sleeper agents to go after her if she ever performs in Columbia.\r \rOne of them is already dead, so you&apos;ll have to make sure the other three follow his lead and Usseewa.  These losers are clearly not ready for the show.\r\rAs always, happy hunting. Remember, 47, Adomination is inevitable.",
